  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://bsf.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Border Security Force (BSF)</a></span> has released the exam date for the Probationary Assistant Sub Inspector ASI Stenographer and Head Constable HC Ministerial Post. This recruitment was released for 1526 posts. Applications for BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno Recruitment 2024 were filled from 09 June 2024 to 08 July 2024. The written examination is going to be conducted in September 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Border Security Force (BSF)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 June 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>08 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 July 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>05 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>01 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam Date : <strong>September 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>100/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<b>0/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno Notification 2024 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno 2024 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1752 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">256</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Head Constable HC Ministerial</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1496</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno Bharti 2024 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5841%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.4159%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Eligibility</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5841%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI Stenographer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.4159%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12th Intermediate Exam from Any Recognized Board in India</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Stenographer Skill (Dictation : 10 Minutes @ 80 WPM, Transcription : 50 Minutes in English / 65 Minutes in Hindi).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.5841%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Head Constable HC Ministerial</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.4159%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12th Intermediate Exam from Any Recognized Board in India</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Typing Test (English : 35 WPM <strong>OR</strong>&nbsp;Hindi : 30 WPM)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BSF HC Ministerial and ASI Steno Online Form 2024 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PST &amp; PET</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Typing / Skill Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their BSF HCM &amp; ASI Steno Exam Date candidates are required to go to the important link sec